# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Relay codegen output. Unlike seslogin, this project does not commit generated
# Relay artifacts — `npm run relay` runs as a prebuild/pretest/pretypecheck step
# (see package.json) so they always exist when needed, and committing them would
# just be diff noise.
src/**/__generated__/

